title: "Chaos on a breadboard: Sprott's diode jerk circuit"
abstract: >-
  Measurements of Sprott's (2011) diode jerk circuit, built on a breadboard and recorded with a USB
  oscilloscope, compared with a model that has nothing fitted. Build guide, data, analysis code and figures.
